# Sky turn: stand in the centre of maps/skytest.vmap and turn a full 360
# degrees left (counter-clockwise) in 32 tics, 2048 angle units per tic
# (issue #155). With --frame-every 2 the frames are 22.5 degrees apart, so
# the 90-degree sky repeat shows as frames 0, 4, 8, 12 looking alike.
vsdemo 1
level 1
skill 2
seed 0
map skytest

in 32 0 0 2048 -
expect health=100
